    "raw_output": "```rust\npub fn multiset_overlap(left: &[i32], right: &[i32]) -> Vec<i32> {\n    let mut result = Vec::new();\n    let mut right_idx = 0;\n\n    for &left_val in left {\n        while right_idx < right.len() {\n            if right[right_idx] == left_val {\n                result.push(left_val);\n                right_idx += 1;\n            } else {\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    result\n}\n```<|im_end|>",
